%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoodMoniWakeUp
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, are you doing alright, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974769
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You've been sleeping in for a while now, did you have trouble falling
      asleep?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Guhh... what time is it Monika?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974787
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It's around 10 in the morning; I've already had breakfast.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974788
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's 10 already?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't remember having trouble sleeping...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe I'm just not used to the stress of all the physical labor we've
      been up to these past few days.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974789
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You mind leaving so I can get dressed? It's kind of awkward talking like
      this.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, sure thing, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974790
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Monika leaves, letting me get dressed to start my day.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974791
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974792
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: As I've been eating a smaller breakfast (since we'll probably be having
      lunch soon), Monika's been glancing over at me with a thoughtful expression.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974793
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Just as I finish my food-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, uh, speaking of stress that you aren't used to...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974796
    - rid: 4351268099428974798
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you doing alright, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974797
    - rid: 4351268099428974799
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, <i>what</i>?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you've got a lot of responsibility on your plate.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974800
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Not only are you a person of power and importance in <i>this</i> world-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974801
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But you're also important to <i>us</i> as a walking library of knowledge
      about this place and how not to die.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974802
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And, uh, well...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974803
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I noticed that you were quick to suggest that Sayori stick with Yuri,
      when she probably would've gone with you if you didn't say anything.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974804
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you trying to suggest something, Monika?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not trying to say you're a bad friend, if that's what you're implying.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974805
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Not to be a psychoanalyst, but I think you're acting like you've got
      too much on your plate.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974806
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look into Monika's eyes for a bit; I know she's not wrong, but I'm
      not sure where she's going with this.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, of course you would feel that way, you've got four teenage girls
      and a world on your shoulders, ahaha!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974807
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And that's funny to you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Not really, no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974808
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, what I want to say is-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974809
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: 'It''d be cliche to say: "you can talk to me, I''m here for you," but-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974810
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It really isn't good to bottle up stuff like that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974811
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And I know you wouldn't want to worry us, but-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974813
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But I'm your club president, right? I'm supposed to be able to be there
      for my club members if they need me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974812
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika, we're not on Earth anymore, I'm not sure if your title of club
      president still stands-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, of course it does!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974814
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't make me assign daily poetry again!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974815
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Heh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: See? I'm helping already, one laugh at a time.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974816
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you have a need-to-be-needed complex or something?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't think so?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974817
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, what do you have planned for today?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974818
    - rid: 4351268099428974819
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I was planning on heading north toward Alftand.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, why are we doing that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: To get an Elder Scroll, to learn a shout, to kill Alduin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Anything you're worried about on the way there?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, well, we should probably upgrade our gear... but we don't exactly
      have the money for that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, do we <i>need</i> to do that today?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974820
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I guess we don't <i>need</i> to do it today...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But! Completing the main quest is the only thing I can think of as far
      as getting back home is concerned.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And that's your responsibility?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974821
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, doing the main quest is the reason the Last Dragonborn existed
      in the first place-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So by that logic, yes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, but I think that trying to rush this might just be putting more
      pressure on yourself, that might not be necessary.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... you might have a point...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I already had a plan all set for today, so let's get it over with for
      now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: If you say so, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974822
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
